@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Delivery Tracking

|Customer|
start
:Open order tracking page;
:Request delivery status;
:Get delivery record by order ID;
if (Delivery exists?) then (Yes)
  :Read current delivery status;
  if (Need fee or address data?) then (Yes)
    :Query GHN service data;
  endif
  :Return tracking info;
  :Render tracking timeline;
else (No)
  :Return no delivery found;
  :Show tracking unavailable message;
endif

if (GHN service error?) then (Yes)
  :Return fallback error;
  :Show delivery error notice;
endif
stop
@enduml
